{2}│{R}{1}⦿ Browse and manage otter images from the registry            {R}{2}│{R}
{2}├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Usage:{R}                                                      {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter reg        [options]{R}                                  {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter registry   [options]{R}                                  {2}│{R}
{2}├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Examples:{R}                                                   {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter reg --all{R}                                             {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter reg pull --all --force{R}                                {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter registry pull fedora{R}                                  {2}│{R}
